======================================================================
SCOPE AND NON-CLAIMS
======================================================================

PHON v0.10.0 is research software. It simulates wave propagation
and neural network inference on CPU using numpy. It does NOT implement
physical photonic or phononic hardware, and it does NOT compile to
fabrication-ready layouts without PDK-specific post-processing.

The "unified wave DSL" claim refers to the mathematical equivalence of
linear wave propagation in photonic and phononic media. Nonlinearity,
dispersion, noise, and fabrication-specific constraints differ between
the two media; PHON models these as future work.

Use at your own risk. No warranty of fitness for production use.
